        <p class="entry-meta">July 2026 to present</p>
        <p>CMMC readiness assessments and CMMC Level 2 assessments for defense contractors, against NIST SP 800-171 and DFARS 252.204-7012 and 252.204-7021. The work covers scoping, enclave boundaries, evidence and control implementation, and advice on gaps before a formal assessment.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="entry">
        <h3>ISSM at Fiber Materials Inc.</h3>
        <p class="entry-meta">July 2025 to July 2026</p>
        <p>Built the security program from scratch and ran the CMMC Level 2 effort from gap assessment through C3PAO engagement. Hardened and maintained classified systems under DCSA oversight using RMF and NIST SP 800-53, deployed EDR, SIEM, ITDR and MFA, and reported risk to the executive team.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="entry">
        <h3>SOC Analyst I and II at Systems Engineering</h3>
        <p class="entry-meta">August 2022 to June 2025</p>
